The '''Bantha Plains''' were a location on the [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. The Plains were located between the [[Northern Dune Sea]] and [[B'omarr Flats]]<ref name="SWCL" /> and were a sandy region inhabited by wild [[bantha]]s.<ref name="RotJ" />

